# Force LF in the working tree for all text files, on every platform.
#
# NOT optional: prompt files embed their newlines in multi-line template
# literals, and the golden tests pin prompt BYTES.
# A CRLF checkout would silently rewrite every prompt string.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
